      "text": "Check that `OPENAI_API_KEY` is set in `.env.local` and that the server was restarted after you\nadded it. The app reads the key at request time, so a restart is required. If the page loads but starting a session fails immediately, the server cannot reach OpenAI. Check\nthe terminal running `npm run dev` for the exact upstream status.",
