    {
      "id": "troubleshooting#6",
      "docId": "troubleshooting",
      "title": "Troubleshooting",
      "heading": "It cannot hear me",
      "text": "The browser asks for microphone permission the first time. If you dismissed it, the permission icon\nusually sits at the left of the address bar; click it and allow the microphone, then reload. On iOS, audio only starts after you tap the page once. Safari will not let a page play sound until\nit has been interacted with. Some browsers and operating systems mute a tab when it is not focused. If it works in one window and\nnot another, check that the other window actually has focus.",
