      "docId": "troubleshooting",
      "title": "Troubleshooting",
      "heading": "The reply is choppy or the assistant talks over me",
      "text": "The app connects over WebRTC where it can and falls back to a WebSocket otherwise. WebSocket carries\naudio as a stream of compressed chunks, so it is noticeably more sensitive to a poor connection than\nWebRTC is. On a slow or lossy connection the WebSocket path will sound rougher; that is the\ntransport, not the app.",
